#: ../../extend/publishing.md:1
msgid "打包、发布与安装"
msgstr "Packaging, publishing and installing"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:3
msgid "包的形态"
msgstr "Package layout"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:5
msgid ""
"一个扩展就是一个可导入的模块或包，**入口不需要 entry_points**：sapic 按模块名加载， "
"模块里的元数据与函数就是全部契约（见[钩子基础契约](contract.md)）。"
msgstr ""
"An extension is just an importable module or package — **no entry_points "
"needed**: sapic loads it by module name, and the metadata and functions "
"inside are the whole contract (see [Hook basics](contract.md))."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:15
msgid "要点："
msgstr "Key points:"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:17
msgid ""
"**模块名就是钩子名**，也是 Provider 的 URL 片段（`/auth/oidc/<name>`）、 `hooks_state` / "
"`hooks_config` 的键、后端行的 `hook_name`。改名等于换一个插件。"
msgstr ""
"**The module name is the hook name**, and also the provider URL segment "
"(`/auth/oidc/<name>`), the key in `hooks_state` / `hooks_config` and the "
"`hook_name` of a backend row. Renaming it is the same as shipping a "
"different plugin."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:19
msgid "`__version__` 与 `__author__` 必填，否则模块会被跳过（日志里有 warning）。"
msgstr ""
"`__version__` and `__author__` are required, otherwise the module is "
"skipped (with a warning in the log)."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:20
msgid "只能声明自己实现的目录：`auth` / `upload` / `processor`，其余视为纯界面钩子。"
msgstr ""
"Declare only catalogs you actually implement: `auth` / `upload` / "
"`processor`; anything else is treated as a UI-only hook."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:21
msgid ""
"依赖要在代码里做 `try/except ImportError` 降级，并在 `hook_manifest()` 的 `help` 或 action"
" 返回值里给出「请安装 X」的提示。`base.txt` 只装官方内置钩子用到的 SDK， 第三方钩子的依赖由你自己的包声明，不要指望 sapic "
"替你装。"
msgstr ""
"Dependencies must degrade with `try/except ImportError` in your code, and "
"the `help` field of `hook_manifest()` or an action return value should tell"
" the administrator to install X. `base.txt` only ships the SDKs used by the"
" official built-in hooks; a third-party hook declares its own dependencies "
"— do not expect sapic to install them for you."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:24
msgid "一个包只暴露一个钩子；要同时提供驱动与界面块，用同一个模块的 `hook_manifest()` 声明。"
msgstr ""
"One package exposes one hook; to provide a driver and interface blocks "
"together, declare both in the same module `hook_manifest()`."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:26
msgid "安装"
msgstr "Installing"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:28
msgid "后台安装（推荐）"
msgstr "Install from the admin (recommended)"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:34
msgid ""
"等价于 `pip install --target $HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR <package>`，超时 180 秒。 "
"`module` 可以省略：包目录名与模块名一致时扫描即命中，否则需要再调 `POST /api/v2/hooks/import` "
"登记模块名。安装失败会返回 `ok: false` 与 pip 日志。"
msgstr ""
"Equivalent to `pip install --target $HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR <package>` with a"
" 180-second timeout. `module` may be omitted: when the package directory "
"name matches the module name the scan picks it up, otherwise register the "
"module with `POST /api/v2/hooks/import`. A failed install returns `ok: "
"false` plus the pip log."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:38
msgid ""
"`HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR`（默认 `data/hooks`，`sapic_hookpkgstoragedir` 可改）： 只加入 "
"`sys.path`、不参与目录扫描——`pip install --target` 会把依赖一起丢进去， 扫描它们等于执行无关代码。"
msgstr ""
"`HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR` (default `data/hooks`, changeable via "
"`sapic_hookpkgstoragedir`) is only added to `sys.path` and never scanned — "
"`pip install --target` puts dependencies in there too, and scanning them "
"would mean executing unrelated code."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:42
msgid "手动安装"
msgstr "Manual install"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:49
msgid "然后登记模块名（后台「钩子 → 导入」或接口）："
msgstr "Then register the module name (admin → Hooks → Import, or the API):"

