#: ../../extend/publishing.md:65
msgid ""
"`GET /api/v2/hooks/market` 读 `sapic_hookmarketurl` 指向的 JSON 数组（默认官方 "
"`list.json`，6 小时缓存），字段如下："
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/v2/hooks/market` reads the JSON array behind "
"`sapic_hookmarketurl` (the official `list.json` by default, cached for 6 "
"hours) with these fields:"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "字段"
msgstr "Field"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`name`"
msgstr "`name`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "展示名"
