#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`module`"
msgstr "`module`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "模块名，用于合并本地「已加载/已安装」状态"
msgstr "Module name, used to merge the local loaded/installed state"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`desc` / `author`"
msgstr "`desc` / `author`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "说明与作者"
msgstr "Description and author"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`github`"
msgstr "`github`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "仓库，可只写 `owner/repo`"
msgstr "Repository; `owner/repo` is enough"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`pypi`"
msgstr "`pypi`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "包名，支持 `$name` 占位"
msgstr "Package name; the `$name` placeholder is supported"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`home`"
msgstr "`home`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "主页，缺省用 github"
msgstr "Home page; defaults to the GitHub URL"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`status`"
msgstr "`status`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "自定义标记（如 `beta`）"
msgstr "Free-form marker such as `beta`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`appversion`"
msgstr "`appversion`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "面向的 sapic 主版本，V2 钩子写 `\"2.x\"`；缺省视为 V1"
msgstr "Target sapic major version; a V2 hook declares `\"2.x\"`, absent means V1"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:79
msgid ""
"V1 与 V2 的钩子契约互不兼容（V1 靠 `slot_*` 函数，V2 靠 `hook_manifest()` 声明式 UI），所以源里必须用 "
"`appversion` 标出代际：**只有主版本号 ≥ 2 的条目才会进市场**， "
"没写这个字段的老条目一律不展示。例外是本地已经装好并加载的钩子——它照旧显示， 否则管理员在市场页看不到、也没法卸载它。"
msgstr ""
"V1 and V2 hook contracts are incompatible (V1 relies on `slot_*` functions,"
" V2 on the declarative `hook_manifest()` UI), so the source must mark the "
"generation with `appversion`: **only entries with major version ≥ 2 reach "
"the market**, and old entries without the field are never shown. The "
"exception is a hook already installed and loaded locally — it stays "
"visible, otherwise an administrator could neither see nor uninstall it from"
" the market page."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:84
msgid "市场只是数据源：装什么、启用什么仍以 `hooks_imported` / `hooks_state` 为准。"
msgstr ""
"The market is only a data source: what gets installed and enabled is still "
"decided by `hooks_imported` / `hooks_state`."

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:86
msgid "列表由服务端分页，长列表不会一次性推给浏览器："
msgstr ""
"The server paginates the list, so a long listing is never pushed to the "
"browser in one go:"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:106
msgid ""
"`page` 从 1 开始，越界会收敛到最后一页；`page_size` 默认 10、上限 100； 非数字参数返回 "
"`PARAM_ERROR`。`installed` / `loaded` / `enabled` 只对当前页的条目合并。"
msgstr ""
"`page` starts at 1 and out-of-range values clamp to the last page; "
"`page_size` defaults to 10 with a maximum of 100; non-numeric parameters "
"return `PARAM_ERROR`. `installed` / `loaded` / `enabled` are merged for the"
" current page only."

