#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "缺 `__version__` / `__author__`，或模块名没登记、不在 `sys.path`"
msgstr ""
"Missing `__version__` / `__author__`, or the module name is not registered "
"or not on `sys.path`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "出现了但 `kind` 是 `ui`"
msgstr "It shows up but `kind` is `ui`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "没声明 `__catalog__`，核心不会把它当驱动/Provider"
msgstr ""
"`__catalog__` is not declared, so the core does not treat it as a driver or"
" provider"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "`warnings` 提示缺函数"
msgstr "`warnings` reports a missing function"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "声明了 `upload` 却缺 `upimg_save`，或 `auth` 缺两个契约函数"
msgstr ""
"It declares `upload` without `upimg_save`, or `auth` without both contract "
"functions"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "后端列表里没有它"
msgstr "It is missing from the backend list"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "钩子未启用，或缺 `upimg_save`；启用后需要一次 `GET /backends` 触发 `sync_backends`"
msgstr ""
"The hook is not enabled, or `upimg_save` is missing; after enabling, one "
"`GET /backends` triggers `sync_backends`"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "选「私有」保存报 400"
msgstr "Saving a private backend returns 400"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "驱动没实现 `upimg_url`（`driver cannot read private objects`），先补读契约或改用公开直链"
msgstr ""
"The driver does not implement `upimg_url` (`driver cannot read private "
"objects`); add the read contract or use public direct links"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "登录页没有按钮"
msgstr "No button on the login page"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md
msgid "Provider 的 `slot_login_after_form` 在配置不全时返回空，填完 client_id 再看"
msgstr ""
"The provider `slot_login_after_form` returns an empty list while config is "
"incomplete; fill in `client_id` and check again"

#: ../../extend/publishing.md:131
msgid ""
"日志用 `logging.getLogger(__name__)`，不要 `print()`；钩子抛异常不会拖垮整个请求， 但会记录堆栈并按 "
"`code=1` 处理，排查时先看服务端日志。"
msgstr ""
"Log with `logging.getLogger(__name__)` instead of `print()`; an exception "
"in a hook does not take down the request, but the traceback is logged and "
"handled as `code=1`, so check the server log first when debugging."

